sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor L as Learner
  participant API as Express API
  participant PS as PracticeService
  participant DB as SQLite (submissions + jobs)
  participant W as EvaluationWorker
  participant P as EvaluationPipeline
  L->>API: POST /attempts/:id/submissions (Idempotency-Key)
  API->>PS: submit()
  PS->>DB: same key? return existing (200)
  PS->>DB: save SUBMITTED + enqueue job (one transaction)
  API-->>L: 202 + submission id
  loop every 2s
    W->>DB: claim job (lease_until)
  end
  W->>P: run(submission)
  P->>P: RuleEvaluator (blocking finding stops here)
  P->>P: LlmRubricEvaluator: prompt, zod, 1 repair retry
  P->>P: EvidenceVerifier drops unquoted findings
  P-->>W: Feedback (+ error if LLM failed)
  W->>DB: save Feedback, COMPLETED or FAILED (partial)
  L->>API: GET /submissions/:id every 3s
  API-->>L: status + feedback
